## MCP sunucusu

Resmi sunucu: `git+https://github.com/googleads/google-ads-mcp.git`  
Örnek config: [`.cursor/mcp.google-ads.example.json`](.cursor/mcp.google-ads.example.json)  
Kurulum scripti: [`scripts/setup-google-ads-mcp.sh`](scripts/setup-google-ads-mcp.sh) (`uv` / `uvx` ile çalışır)

Gerekli env:

- `GOOGLE_ADS_DEVELOPER_TOKEN` (Explorer+ / production)
- `GOOGLE_PROJECT_ID`
- `GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS` (ADC JSON) **veya** OAuth proxy client id/secret
- Scope: `https://www.googleapis.com/auth/adwords`

